BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (The verification and funds workflow separates commercial facts from state labels. A draft becomes VERIFIED only) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (after payer evidence exists and the unit has a recorded landlord addendum. RESERVED additionally requires any) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (contractual deposit to appear as posted cash against that placement's deposit liability. A deposit is not retained revenue.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (If local rules require a trust account or regulated escrow arrangement, use the required custodian and maintain a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (separate bank-control implementation; the reference is a liability ledger, not an escrow service. ACTIVE means actual) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (possession, and CLOSED means documented departure, not merely an adjuster's claim closure. A reserved stay can be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (cancelled before possession; an active household needs a lawful departure process. Optimistic version checks reject) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (stale instructions even though writes are serialized. The transition API accepts evidence references rather than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (pretending software can independently authenticate a carrier letter. Bind those references to access-controlled) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (documents and human verification in the application layer. After reservation, inventory dates cannot be edited casually.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (An extension requires an explicit replacement workflow or a separately reserved adjacent interval, with fresh payer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (authority and another overlap check. Never overwrite the original commercial agreement to make a late extension look) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (timely.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (Money posting and external delivery have different correctness boundaries. The journal enforces at least two nonzero) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (lines, a zero signed-cent balance, immutable posted entries, and one payload per business event. Correct a mistake with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (a reversing entry and a replacement event, not an UPDATE to a posted line. The outbox records durable external intent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (in the same transaction as a state change. A worker claims that intent with a unique token before making any external) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (request. Exactly-once delivery cannot be manufactured across an arbitrary housing portal or messaging service: pass) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (the event key where the provider supports idempotency, and quarantine an uncertain outcome otherwise. A crashed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (CLAIMED item requires investigation; it is never automatically returned to READY. This removes competing-worker) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (dispatch races without promising impossible network semantics. ALE Solutions and CRS interfaces should be used) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (only through authorized integrations or documented manual submissions, with portal receipts retained. Smart-lock) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (provisioning uses the same outbox pattern but needs a separate access policy. Never tie an occupied household's door) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (access to a delinquent invoice. The six modules establish transactional correctness for their stated scope; vendor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (authentication, document review, and lawful occupancy decisions remain explicit operating responsibilities.) Tj ET
